Every `source-map-js` divergence is a duplicate generated column with differing originals; `source-map-js` orders the tie by content, the spec keeps segment order. For `mappings="AAKK,AAJJ"` (col 0 → originals `(5,5)` then `(1,1)`): this fix returns `line:6, column:5`; `source-map-js` returns `line:2, column:1`. `GetOriginalPositions` returns the stable-ordered list, so element 0 is `(5,5)`.

